  dialogues:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: CONNIE_Hello
      Value:
      - "<wave><color=red>Hey, pal.,</color>\nTest\n\xA4<wave><color=red>TestTwo</color>"
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ABBIE_Hello
      Value:
      - Hi... I'm new here. I hope everything is alright?
      - Bonjour
    - Key: MAX_Hello
      Value:
      - Good morning!
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ROSA_Hello
      Value:
      - Hello dear!
      - "Bonjour mon ch\xE9rie"
    - Key: LI_Hello
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new. Uh\u2026 hi."
      - "Hey pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t do that
        again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new friends?\xA4Not
        much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five
        if you count Esteban; though the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem neither
        does Devi to be honest.\xA4And Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of
        the bunch.\xA4All smiles and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when
        you least expect it.\xA4Again I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s
        a shark tank here and you wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go
        just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
    - Key: DEVI_Hello
      Value:
      - "\u2026What? Is there something on my face?"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_A
      Value:
      - "Hey, fella!\n\n\xA4You\u2019re new here,\nam I right?\n\n\xA4\u2026eh, who
        am I kidding.\n\n\xA4'Whole floor knows about\nour little newcomer!\n\n\xA4Sorry,
        'guess that wasn\u2019t the\nwarm welcome you expected\u2026\n\n\xA4Ah, don\u2019t
        blame them.\nEverybody\u2019s on edge lately.\n\n\xA4Thought I\u2019d at
        least come by\nand greet you properly.\n\n\xA4Anyway, took enough of your
        time.\n\n\xA4See you tomorrow, pal!"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_A
      Value:
      - ...
      - 
    - Key: MAX_A
      Value:
      - "Oh! Sorry for surprising you.\xA4Didn\u2019t expect to see a new face here.
        Forgot you were replacing the other guy.\xA4A shame. I quite liked him. Though
        I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll fit right in as well!\xA4Anyway nice to meet you!
        Don\u2019t worry I probably won\u2019t make your job too hard. My reports
        are always flawless.\xA4See you tomorrow!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_B_Bad
      Value:
      - "Hey\xF9 pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t
        do that again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new
        friends?\xA4Not much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only
        the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five\xF9 if you count Esteban; though the guy
        doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem\xF9 neither does Devi\xF9 to be honest.\xA4And
        Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of the bunch.\xA4All smiles\xF9 and
        just ready to plant a dagger in your back when you least expect it.\xA4Again\xF9
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s a shark tank here\xF9 and you
        wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad
        you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_B_Good
      Value:
      - "Hey\xF9 pal!\xA4Thanks for covering my ass yesterday.\xA4Knew you were a
        real mate.\xA4Really appreciate it. And you know I\u2019ll return the favor.\xA4So!
        Met any new friends?\xA4Not much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s
        only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five\xF9 if you count Esteban; though
        the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem\xF9 neither does Devi to be honest.
        And Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of the bunch.\xA4All smiles\xF9
        and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when you least expect it.\xA4Again\xF9
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s a shark tank here\xF9 and you
        wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad
        you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: LI_A
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new.\n\n\xA4Uh\u2026 hi."
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_B
      Value:
      - "\u2026\xA4What? Is there something on my face?"
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_A
      Value:
      - ...
      - 
    - Key: MAXINE_DayThree
      Value:
      - "Oh! Sorry for surprising you.\n\n\xA4Didn\u2019t expect to see a new face
        here. \nForgot you were replacing the other gal.\n\xA4A shame. I quite liked
        her. \n<!sprite=Wink>Though I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll fit right in as well!\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You
        know, I think you\u2019re going \nto bring some much-needed life up here.\n\xA4Floor
        was getting pretty dull with only the four of us.\n\n\xA4\u2026Five, if you
        count Esteban, \nthough the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\n\xA4Ahem, neither
        does Devi, to be honest.\n\n\xA4Anyway, nice to meet you! \nDon\u2019t worry,
        I probably won\u2019t make your job too hard. \n\xA4<!sprite=Wink>Haven\u2019t
        failed a single report ever since I joined, \nand I well intend to continue!\n\xA4See
        you tomorrow!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNOR_DayThree
      Value:
      - "\xA4<sprite=Happy>So! Met any new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max
        earlier.\nI\u2019d be careful in your place.\n\n\xA4<sprite=Default>All smiles,
        and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again,
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here, and
        you wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go just to earn a promotion.\n\n\xA4<sprite=Happy>Glad
        you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_DayThree
      Value:
      - "\u2026\n\n\xA4What? Is there something on my face?"
      - 
